    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join this brave little guy!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391200/extras/f85588e0e27f7975ee50f024e9885d57.avif?t=1748052506\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's about to embark on a grand journey to find his friends in this heartwarming adventure game. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative, single-player experience made with all the charm you deserve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scamper around the snowcapped peaks of Grumble Mountain and discover a world full of possibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle bullies, wolves, and firebees in frantically fun snowball fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn into a snowball and tumble down icy slopes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet dozens of unforgettable characters. Like this snowman named Sherbert!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391200/extras/64c2fb7f48c74842c48ea2eb1bb7d60a.avif?t=1748052506\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join this brave little guy!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391200/extras/f85588e0e27f7975ee50f024e9885d57.avif?t=1748052506\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's about to embark on a grand journey to find his friends in this heartwarming adventure game. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative, single-player experience made with all the charm you deserve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scamper around the snowcapped peaks of Grumble Mountain and discover a world full of possibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle bullies, wolves, and firebees in frantically fun snowball fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn into a snowball and tumble down icy slopes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet dozens of unforgettable characters. Like this snowman named Sherbert!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391200/extras/64c2fb7f48c74842c48ea2eb1bb7d60a.avif?t=1748052506\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul>",
